      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Here is what the \"Details\" section currently looks like in 1441, for reference. The \"Size\" panel breaks the organization of everything related to player count being on the same line.\n\nIt's very awkward from a UX perspective for player count details to start arbitrarily on the 2nd panel after download size.",
